WEB3 Cards / Major updates

I have compiled exactly what will be useful to everyone.

@payy_link / 24 Sep Ethereum bridge drained (~$1.92M USDC); deposits, withdrawals, transfers and all card / Apple / Google Pay paused. User deposits stolen; no audit report or restart date yet.
@gnosispay / GNO cashback until 30 Sep 23:59 UTC (spend by 28 Sep to be safe; must settle by 5 Oct); final payout 7 Oct. No new cards after 30 Sep. Consumer card + web app die 20 Dec; Safe / withdrawals stay. Set a backup / migrate to Rebind.
@okx / September boost: 2% cashback, €100 cap for Regular after in-app opt-in; USDG only. Cap reverts 1 Oct.
@oobit / until 1 Oct, up to 10% from purchase #1, no tiers. From 1 Oct, Level 2 / $250 spend in 90 days returns.
@Plasma / 10% eBay until 28 Sep. New: 10% Eight Sleep Pod 6 until 9 Oct (Platinum only; new Platinum up to $300, existing up to $150, paid in XPL). Queue dropped 23 Sep; card open to all + invite-only Aurora tier.
@RedotPay / since 21 Sep, Card Deposit from PayPal / Wise / Revolut and 15+ apps.
@JupiterExchange / physical Visa rolling out in waves: $13.13 + shipping; $1,500+ balance gets $30 off tracked shipping. Virtual still free, USDC 1:1 to USD.
@Krak / @krakenfx / Metal is Max-only; Metal Max limits up to €100k spend / €20k withdrawals per month. From 15 Oct tier thresholds rise (Lite $1k, Pro $10k, Elite $75k, Max $150k). Salary Match still live in eligible EEA/UK.
@ether_fi / cashback now in ETHFI; $5 min claim, 7-day clearing. Luxe/Pinnacle/VIP get up to 30% on AI/food/streaming/travel. 1-in-10 iPhone promo ended 18 Sep.
@DeblockApp / free XCover included: Standard = purchase protection (need 1 card payment/month); Premium = travel + car rental.
@KoloHub / outbound EUR to any IBAN: SEPA Instant where supported, €1 flat, 24/7. Offramp, not a named salary IBAN.
@raincards / MoneyGram Card live, Colombia first, USDC, virtual Visa + Apple/Google Pay + cash pickup at MoneyGram. Physical late 2026.
@kardpay / early-bird physical sold out; shipping mid-October for those who ordered.
@PulsarMoneyApp / Pro is live: 2x points on Uber/Bolt/ChatGPT/Claude/X; launch offer was 100% back on first Pro month if still shown in-app.
@usemotocard / fake site/account still circulating don’t use it.

If you see something interesting, share it in the comments!

